              <p>Installed software is checked against NVD, CISA’s Known Exploited Vulnerabilities list, and EPSS scores, so you fix what’s most likely to be exploited first.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <div purpose="feature-image">
